{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras/\u753b\u50cf\uff11_EN.png?t=1748249029\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras/\u753b\u50cf\uff12.png?t=1748249029\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Kimi Muzi&quot; is a comical shooter with a fantasy theme! You become a saint and face off against approaching monsters. Use normal shots and special moves such as lightning to repel hordes of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character Introduction</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras/\u753b\u50cf\uff13.jpg?t=1748249029\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lottie \u3000voice actor: Nanami Yuri</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist.A saint who can exorcise evil spirits, she is forced to take on the impossible task of purifying a remote area all by herself after her fiance, the third prince, breaks off their engagement. She is naive and seriously believes that children are born from cabbages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras/\u753b\u50cf\uff14.jpg?t=1748249029\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Orcs </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monsters born from the harmful miasma that overflows from the Demon Forest. After wreaking havoc for a hundred years, they are finally ready to be purified. Seeing potential in Lotti, the Orcs make the unexpected decision to train her and have her purify them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">game rules</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras/\u753b\u50cf\uff15.jpg?t=1748249029\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use shots to repel approaching monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras/\u753b\u50cf\uff16.jpg?t=1748249029\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If Lotti's stamina runs out after being hit by enemy bullets, or if the &quot;barrier&quot; is destroyed and monsters are allowed in, she will lose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras/\u753b\u50cf\uff17.png?t=1748249029\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Running out of strength, Lotti is kidnapped by the orcs and taken straight to the training room! Endure the intensive training and get revenge on the orcs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras/\u753b\u50cf\uff18.jpg?t=1748249029\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the gold you extort from the orcs to purchase power-up items! Acquire new functions to gain an advantage in battle!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3486810?t=1748249029","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/548ebe5abe72f7758bd5b6be4a343ca1389ef3fd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748249029","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/9d7042bd599fdc6ab7a53d7303a7880d7bbd24cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748249029","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/9d7042bd599fdc6ab7a53d7303a7880d7bbd24cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17482490